       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CLASSE1.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-VALOR-TEXTO      PIC X(5)      VALUE "12 45".
       01  WS-VALOR REDEFINES WS-VALOR-TEXTO PIC 9(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF WS-VALOR NUMERIC
               DISPLAY "VALOR OK: " WS-VALOR
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "VALOR INVALIDO: [" WS-VALOR-TEXTO "]"
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
